      "en": "Answer: gab. The simple past predominates in fairy tales, written narratives and reports of past events. The perfect is common in conversation. Sein, haben, modal verbs and forms such as wusste, fand, ging and es gab are also frequent in spoken simple past. Register, region and context matter."
